              "id": "s5_2_12",
              "cn": "他见人很怕羞，只是不怕我，没有旁人的时候，便和我说话，于是不到半日，我们便熟识了。",
              "pinyin": "Tā jiàn rén hěn pàxiū, zhǐshì búpà wǒ, méiyǒu pángrén de shíhou, biàn hé wǒ shuōhuà, yúshì búdào bànrì, wǒmen biàn shúshi le.",
              "en": "He was very shy with people, but not with me. When nobody else was around he would talk to me, and in less than half a day we were friends.",
