              "id": "s5_2_13",
              "cn": "我们那时候不知道谈些什么，只记得闰土很高兴，说是上城之后，见了许多没有见过的东西。",
              "pinyin": "Wǒmen nà shíhou bùzhīdào tán xiē shénme, zhǐ jìde Rùntǔ hěn gāoxìng, shuō shì shàngchéng zhīhòu, jiàn le xǔduō méiyǒu jiànguò de dōngxi.",
              "en": "I don't know what we talked about then; I only remember that Runtu was very happy, and said that since coming to town he had seen lots of things he'd never seen before.",
