              "pinyin": "Wǒmen shādì shàng, xià le xuě, wǒ sǎo chū yíkuài kòngdì lái, yòng duǎn bàng zhī qǐ yígè dà zhúbiǎn, sāxià bǐgǔ, kàn niǎoquè lái chī shí, wǒ yuǎnyuǎn de jiāng fù zài bàng shàng de shéngzi zhǐ yì lā, nà niǎoquè jiù zhàozài zhúbiǎn xià le.",
              "en": "On our sandy land, when it snows, I sweep a patch clear, prop up a big bamboo tray with a short stick and scatter some husks. When the birds come to eat, I give one tug from far away on the string tied to the stick, and the birds are trapped under the tray.",
