              "cn": "可惜正月过去了，闰土须回家里去，我急得大哭，他也躲到厨房里，哭着不肯出门，但终于被他父亲带走了。",
              "pinyin": "Kěxī zhēngyuè guòqù le, Rùntǔ xū huí jiālǐ qù, wǒ jí de dàkū, tā yě duǒ dào chúfáng lǐ, kū zhe bùkěn chūmén, dàn zhōngyú bèi tā fùqīn dàizǒu le.",
              "en": "Sadly, the first month came to an end and Runtu had to go home. I was so upset I burst into tears, and he hid in the kitchen, crying and refusing to leave, but in the end his father took him away.",
