              "cn": "他出去了；母亲和我都叹息他的景况：多子，饥荒，苛税，兵，匪，官，绅，都苦得他像一个木偶人了。",
              "pinyin": "Tā chūqù le; mǔqīn hé wǒ dōu tànxī tā de jǐngkuàng: duōzǐ, jīhuāng, kēshuì, bīng, fěi, guān, shēn, dōu kǔ de tā xiàng yígè mù'ǒu rén le.",
              "en": "After he went out, Mother and I both sighed over his situation: too many children, famine, harsh taxes, soldiers, bandits, officials, gentry — all of them had worn him down until he was like a wooden puppet.",
