              "cn": "老屋离我愈远了；故乡的山水也都渐渐远离了我，但我却并不感到怎样的留恋。",
              "pinyin": "Lǎowū lí wǒ yù yuǎn le; gùxiāng de shānshuǐ yě dōu jiànjiàn yuǎnlí le wǒ, dàn wǒ què bìngbù gǎndào zěnyàng de liúliàn.",
              "en": "The old house fell further and further behind me; the hills and rivers of my hometown were slowly leaving me too, yet I felt no great reluctance to go.",
